# Cloudflare Pages header rules. Matching rules are ADDITIVE, not
# override-by-specificity: a request under /app/* also matches /* below,
# so both rule blocks' headers apply and same-named headers get
# comma-joined unless removed first with "! Header-Name" (used below for
# CSP). See docs/DEPLOY.md for how this was verified against the real
# `flutter build web -t lib/main_web.dart` output, and why the /app/*
# policy differs from the static site's.
#
# Do not add the anon key or any credential here — this file ships to
# every visitor's browser as plain response headers.

/*
  # HSTS -- HTTPS ONLY, AND REMEMBERED.
  #
  # Without this, a visitor who types `manaline.in` makes one plaintext
  # request before the redirect to HTTPS, and that one request is where a
  # network in between gets to answer instead. On a site people sign into,
  # that is the request worth removing.
  #
  # DELIBERATELY SHORT TO BEGIN WITH. max-age is a promise a browser HOLDS:
  # for as long as it lasts, that browser will refuse to reach this host over
  # HTTP at all, and there is no way to reach back and tell it otherwise. Get
  # it wrong at a year and the mistake outlives every fix. 300 seconds is long
  # enough to prove the header arrives and short enough that a mistake ages
  # out over a cup of tea.
  #
  # THE RAMP, once the custom domain is attached and serving:
  #   300                      -> confirm with: curl -sI https://<host> | grep -i strict
  #   86400                    -> leave for a day
  #   31536000; includeSubDomains
  #
  # includeSubDomains is NOT set yet on purpose: it binds every subdomain of
  # this host, including ones that do not exist yet, and a future
  # `staging.manaline.in` without a valid certificate would be unreachable
  # rather than merely warned about.
  #
  # `preload` is NOT set and should not be added casually. It ships the domain
  # inside browser binaries, removal takes months, and it is the one setting
  # here that cannot be undone by a deploy.
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=300
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/app/*
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://www.gstatic.com blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://www.gstatic.com https://fonts.gstatic.com https://*.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
